摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Engineering workflow layer for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): a disciplined-engineer agent preset with five gated phases — requirements clarification, plan approval, TDD, parallel subagent execution, and verified finishing. Skills adapted from obra/superpowers.","id":"gh:1335988605","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-engineering-workflow","slug":"82c86b8z86-stack/dsh-engineering-workflow","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Engineering workflow layer for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): a disciplined-engineer agent preset with five"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" gated phases — requirements clarification, plan approval, TDD, parallel subagent execution, and ver"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ified finishing. Skills adapted from obra/superpowers."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-engineering-workflow"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"An engineering workflow layer for DeepSeek Harness (dsh). One install adds the **工程工作流 (Engineering "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"Workflow)** agent preset — a disciplined-engineer mode with five hard-gated phases — plus six workfl"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ow skills that carry the methodology."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The workflow methodology is adapted from obra/superpowers (MIT): brainstorming, writing-plans, TDD, "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"subagent-driven development, and verification-before-completion, reworked for dsh's native tools (pl"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"an mode + `exit_plan_mode`, background `subagent`/`subagent_fork`, `workflow` orchestration, goals, "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"and the preset/skill system)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## The five phases"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Phase | Skill | Gate | dsh mechanism |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| ① Requirements clarification | `workflow-requirements` | Intent approved before any code | `ask_us"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"er_question`, one question at a time |\n| ② Plan approval | `workflow-planning` | Plan approved via `"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"exit_plan_mode` | plan mode, `todo_write` after approval |\n| ③ TDD implementation | `workflow-tdd` |"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" Failing test before production code | `pwsh`/`bash` test runs |\n| ④ Parallel subagent execution | `"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"workflow-subagents` | Per-task review + ledger | background `subagent`, `send_message`, `list_agents"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"` |\n| ⑤ Verified finishing | `workflow-verification` | Fresh evidence before claims | full suite + b"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"nishing | `workflow-verification` | Fresh evidence before claims | full suite + branch-finish menu |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The master skill `engineering-workflow` routes every non-trivial task to the right phase and enforce"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"s the discipline rules (rationalization red flags included)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"(Or `npm install` the package into your profile and add `dsh-engineering-workflow` to `dsh.profile.b"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"install` the package into your profile and add `dsh-engineering-workflow` to `dsh.profile.bundles`.)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart dsh once so the host plugin mounts. On startup it syncs the preset into `~/.dsh/.agent-prese"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ts/engineering-workflow`; the preset then appears in the new-session preset picker as **工程工作流**. The"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" sync is idempotent — upgrading the plugin updates the preset and its skills automatically."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Manual / development fallback without a restart:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"dsh re-discovers presets on every roster read, so the synced preset is selectable immediately."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The preset wires its skills through `@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-filesystem` with `customSkillDirs` roote"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"d at the preset's own directory — the same pattern the shipped `cordis` preset uses, so the skill ca"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"talog travels with the preset wherever it is installed."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Verify the install"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"This compares the bundled preset against `~/.dsh/.agent-presets` without writing anything. If it rep"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"orts `stale` or `missing`, run `node scripts/sync-presets.mjs` (or restart dsh once so the host plug"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ssing`, run `node scripts/sync-presets.mjs` (or restart dsh once so the host plugin syncs on mount)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Where the plugin takes effect:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- The **preset picker** (new-session dialog) lists **工程工作流** — dsh re-discovers presets on every ros"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ter read, so a synced preset appears without a restart. Pick it for a new session; existing sessions"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" and the default preset are never switched.\n- The **system-prompt announcement** (the workflow guida"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"nce the model reads) appears in sessions created after the host plugin mounted — i.e. after the firs"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"t dsh restart following the install.\n- The six workflow skills load with the preset and are invocabl"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"e via the `skill` tool in those sessions."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT. The preset composition is adapted from the DeepSeek Harness built-in `cordis` preset (MIT); the"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" workflow methodology is adapted from obra/superpowers (MIT); the preset-sync host-plugin pattern fo"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"llows `@linxin666/dsh-liangshen` (Apache-2.0). See `presets/engineering-workflow/NOTICE`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
